COPY public.reviews (id, rating, text, author_name, author_location, vehicle_owned, is_verified, product_id) FROM stdin;
rev-1	5	I was skeptical about the price. But the cut-off line on my Scorpio-N is razor sharp. No blinding oncoming traffic, just pure daylight. Worth every rupee.	Rohan K.	Hyderabad	Scorpio-N Z8L	t	prod-5
rev-2	5	I use my Hilux in very foggy conditions in the mountains. The 18 inch Combo Amber lightbar provides excellent visibility in fog and rain.	Jagadish Kumar	Nilgiris	Toyota Hilux	t	prod-6
rev-3	5	The installation was incredibly easy - true plug and play. My Jimny now lights up mountain trails like it's noon. Best upgrade I've made to the car.	Priya M.	Bangalore	Maruti Jimny	t	prod-3
rev-4	5	After 2 years and countless off-road trips, not a single issue. The warranty gives peace of mind, but these lights are genuinely built to last. American engineering shows.	Arjun D.	Pune	Toyota Hilux	t	prod-2
rev-5	5	The SS3 Pro pods completely transformed my Thar's night driving capability. The TIR optics focus light exactly where needed - no scatter, no glare for oncoming traffic.	Vikram S.	Delhi	Mahindra Thar	t	prod-5
